  - id: the_good_shepherd
    displayName: The Good Shepherd
    flavorText: Jesus describes himself as the good shepherd who knows his sheep
      and lays down his life for them willingly.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: "Jesus describes his relationship to his followers through shepherd
      imagery \u2014 knowing his sheep, laying down his life for them willingly,
      and gathering 'other sheep' beyond the immediate fold \u2014 teaching that
      provokes a charge of blasphemy from his hearers."
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_john
    managerId: good_shepherd_discourse_john
    icon: {fileID: 0}
