  - id: the_true_vine
    displayName: The True Vine
    flavorText: Jesus, in the upper room, tells his disciples, 'I am the true vine,'
      and commands them to love one another.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'On the night before his crucifixion, Jesus prepares his disciples for
      his departure: comforting them, promising the coming of the Holy Spirit, describing
      their ongoing relationship to him through the vine-and-branches image, commanding
      them to love one another, and warning them of the world''s coming hatred.'
    deliveredByManagerId: jesus_john
    managerId: upper_room_discourse_john
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
    baseCost: 362554.6853724344
    costGrowthRate: 1.15
